summary: D437 lets a module value read a compiler fact as the value configuration found, here and through another module: an integer fact taking its type from context, a feature and a C ABI bool, an atom fact compared with a configuration atom even where the atom's word also names an imported module, and an integer fact in an array image; each agrees with what a fixed if selects for the same fact, so the status is the same on every target
